#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Update Delivery Engine
#  File: update_delivery_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS update delivery engine:
#      • update manifests
#      • delta patch staging
#      • signature verification
#      • atomic commit
#      • rollback checkpoints
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Manifests](ca://s?q=Explain_Update_Manifests)
#    - [Delta Staging](ca://s?q=Explain_Delta_Staging)
#    - [Signature Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Update_Signature_Verification)
#    - [Atomic Commit](ca://s?q=Explain_Atomic_Update_Commit)
#    - [Rollback](ca://s?q=Explain_Update_Rollback)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_manifest(version, manifest)
#         Registers update manifest.
#
#    - stage(version)
#         Stages update for commit.
#
#    - commit(stage_id)
#         Applies update atomically.
#
#    - checkpoint()
#         Creates rollback point.
#
#    - rollback(checkpoint_id)
#         Restores previous version.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns update engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MANIFEST FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "version": "2.1.0",
#      "signature": "<hmac>",
#      "key": "system.master",
#      "data": <binary>,
#      "patch": { ... }
#    }
#
